{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/playsmart02.jpg?t=1732597425\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an enthralling journey through the intricate world of One Dash Star, a physics-based puzzle game that will challenge your dexterity and strategic thinking. In this captivating adventure, you'll guide a marble towards its celestial destination, navigating through a series of increasingly intricate levels filled with fixed and moving obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/01.gif?t=1732597425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/gameplay02.jpg?t=1732597425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gameplay of One Dash Star is deceptively simple yet undeniably engaging. With a simple click and drag motion of your mouse or a flick of the joystick, you'll trace a path for the marble, guiding it with precision and finesse. Your objective is clear: deliver the marble safely to its designated star. But achieving this goal won't be easy. As you progress through the game, you'll encounter a diverse array of obstacles that will test your focus, reflexes, and strategic thinking.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/02.gif?t=1732597425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/features02.jpg?t=1732597425\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intuitive and Addictive Gameplay:</strong> Master the art of guiding the marble with simple yet precise mouse or controller movements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse and Challenging Levels:</strong> Each level presents a unique set of obstacles, demanding strategic thinking and quick reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><strong>Vivid and Vibrant Graphics:</strong> Immerse yourself in a captivating world adorned with colorful and engaging visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upbeat and Motivating Soundtrack:</strong> Experience an exhilarating soundtrack that complements the intense gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><strong>Suitable for All Ages:</strong> Enjoy a fun and challenging experience that appeals to players of all ages and skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/03.gif?t=1732597425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3071150?t=1732597425","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1732597425","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/4fe293b880def86feffe169a767b93751e2644e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1732597425","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/4fe293b880def86feffe169a767b93751e2644e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1732597425","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/playsmart02.jpg?t=1732597425\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_par